{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act20side_level_act20side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act20side",
  "stageId": "act20side_03",
  "title": "奇談怪論",
  "storyCode": "IC-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c6e503620f994ef4a3e5abadda8a4309512d6d6bd78d8afabdef3fbd2262bb65",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，想要炸掉滑梯重修鐵路，就得說服商業代表克羅綺·磚石、工業代表黛柯綺·銀幣，還有那個叫卡奇的傢伙，沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不錯，他們的地位最重要，杜林人們也最願意參考他們的態度來做選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就不能自己去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來你不怎麼受歡迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不用說得這麼直白吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽起來麻煩得很，不過，好吧，就當是為了阿卡胡拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我該去哪裡找他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼，終於結束了。那個嘉維爾真的好嚇人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來真的讓你得逞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶奇老頭，心滿意足了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不瞞你說，我還挺捨不得“大水坑”的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈！誰讓它剛好擋在鐵路橋中間呢？不然我還真找不到由頭對它動手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，我倒有了個新想法，自從穹頂破碎，瀑布落下，這大滑梯建成也有半年多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_564_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然大家玩得還是高興得很，但應該也感覺到有一點無聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_564_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不如我們就趁這個機會，建點新的？你之前和卡奇好像說過一個超級大水炮之類的東西，已經在杜林人中傳開了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_564_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不瞞你說，我也很有興趣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個阿達克利斯人！野蠻、無禮、魯莽、放肆！克羅綺，你能想像嗎？我只不過是創作陷入了瓶頸，想去山洞裡採些野茶，散散心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "結果被人抱著從瀑布頂跳了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "簡直糟糕透頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但恐怕沒有哪個正常的際崖城居民能抵擋這樣的誘惑。如果把它寫成故事，說不定能在城裡大受歡迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“相信嘉維爾吧。”“阿芙朵嘉，抓緊我！”唔，還有點浪漫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可算了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "起碼比你那些有關雪的故事強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，前兩天，有幾個孩子來找我討那幾本短篇小說，我還以為這些書也終於有了讀者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們的讀後感呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“很好笑，下次還來看。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿芙朵嘉，他們沒有惡意。只是，我們杜林人恐怕真的沒法想像你的那些經歷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是聽你說了多少次才瞭解一點你的感覺？更何況普通的杜林人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們連真正的雪都沒見過，更別說你寫的那些......那幾個詞怎麼念來著，“詭詐”“逃亡”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些詞如果只存在於文學之中，才再好不過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總之，我對現在的日子很滿意。不壓榨別人，也不被人壓榨。沒有正在醞釀的恐怖陰謀，也不會捲入陷害與刺殺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我為我們的商店街寫幾條廣告、設計幾件標牌就足夠填飽肚子。還有什麼不滿足的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我每天只用悠閒地在躺椅上沐浴陽光——雖然只是人造光源，但足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我真希望這樣平靜的日子繼續下去，直到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是商業代表克羅綺·磚石的辦公室嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好，我想把那個大滑梯炸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喲，阿芙朵嘉，你也在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她臉色不太好哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不好意思，克羅綺，我可能得先失陪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要回趟家，重新保養一下這把弩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是不是真的惹她生氣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳嗯，幾位剛到際崖城不久吧？我聽卡奇提起過你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼說呢，他這次的評價倒還挺準確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“一幫比杜林還要杜林的傢伙。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "躲避！躲避！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯，結構很奇怪，和Lancet-2大姐給人的感覺完全不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請保持距離！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "看起來不如大姐聰明，但也有一些基本的反應，這是什麼原理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "威脅度高！陌生人，保持距離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "放輕鬆，小傢伙，我叫祖瑪瑪，不是什麼壞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "定義身份，祖瑪瑪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "屬性：為杜林族服務的光榮的R3-E3型助理機器人，編號0429。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你好，0429，你的減震系統出問題了嗎？為什麼搖搖晃晃的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自檢報告：服役年限臨近，元器件老化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我可以幫忙。看，我有全套的檢修工具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "檢修......判定可執行度，低。R3-E3服役期滿後即報廢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "小傢伙，我看你的狀況沒什麼大問題，別自暴自棄。大概只要擰上幾顆螺絲就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你很可愛，我願意幫你，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我們可以當朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "朋友？無法理解，朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以幫我檢修嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "不過首先需要切開你的外殼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，申請取消任務，申請取消任務，危險，危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "沒事的，別跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_569_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我是不是看到了一個來自地上的斐迪亞正追著助理機器人跑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_569_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真奇怪，昨天喝多了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_569_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，阿芙朵嘉那些叫人半懂不懂的故事裡，描寫的大概就是這種場景吧，有關“追殺”的那些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_569_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，我大概知道她為什麼說這不是喜劇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "依娜姆小姐，要茶嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來杜林人也會喝除了酒之外的液體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "偶爾也想換換口味。況且，咳，畢竟還在工作，喝酒還是留給休閒時間吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你提議我們可以單獨聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我毫不懷疑嘉維爾的打架實力，不過在這種事情上，她的拳頭估計派不上什麼用場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟，我們恐怕是一類人，際崖城的商業代表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來你是個喜歡談買賣的人，正巧，我也不討厭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "際崖城只是一座小小的杜林聚落，前些年，我們還與其他城市連通的時候，我作為商業代表還算是有些工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過自從上次的地震以後，唯一的鐵路斷絕，好在際崖城足夠自給自足，居民們也比較無欲無求，重新恢復交通就顯得沒那麼急迫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如今我的工作無非是迎合際崖城市民們的喜好，推出點娛樂活動罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "管一管“大水坑”附近的小販啦，推出些新的自走車配件啦，清閒得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不是很瞭解杜林人的觀念，不過一般來說，把自己喝得爛醉然後去衝浪算是一種無欲無求嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，按照地上人的標準......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算的，按照我們的標準，這就是無欲無求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，不管斯第奇向你允諾了什麼，如果你想說服我同意你們炸滑梯的計畫，就拿出點真正能打動我的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "互相都願意交換，生意才算成立。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "依娜姆小姐，你能為際崖城的商業帶來什麼呢？阿卡胡拉的那些手工藝品可不夠有吸引力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我聽說敏銳的自走車商家們已經用你們這幾位外來者的形象在配件上做文章了，但這也還不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......比我想像的要瞭解地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然我沒有親身去過地上，但城裡的圖書館可不是擺設。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我十分清楚你們的那些習俗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿卡胡拉人會不眠不休地圍著磐蟹跳舞，堅持到最後的就可以獲得大王的稱號，沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你從哪看來的這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "《奇談怪論》啊。這可是際崖城最流行的書，當年一位大冒險家從地上帶了好大一套下來。可堪稱是有關地上世界的百科全書了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就是個胡編亂造的雜誌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不會吧？我為了看懂這些書，還辛辛苦苦學了薩爾貢語呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怪不得你幾乎沒什麼口音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，突然沒什麼動力了，感覺幾本最新的《奇談怪論》就能收買你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最新的？那些書居然還有續集？！嗯......如果你真的能搞到，是可以考慮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我倒是還有些好東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "錄影帶，要不要看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找到你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，阿芙朵嘉，好巧。又來采風？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們到底想幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克羅綺小姐那裡，依娜姆說交給她搞定，我們就出來找祖瑪瑪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我問的是，地上人，你們為什麼來我們的城市。你們真正的目的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在超方便大升降梯一號那裡守了很久，跟著你們的主力部隊在哪裡？是薩爾貢的王酋們終於看上地下的財富了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這座城市並沒有你們想要的資源，離開吧，如果你們真的不想讓血污染這座平和的小城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都說了是誤會。斯第奇想找人幫他修鐵道，就把我們騙下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這不就是被當做苦力了嗎，這種當也能上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那傢伙當時說得可嚴重了，再加上特米米又誇張了一番......唉，我可是擔心得要死，和祖瑪瑪連夜做好了打硬仗的準備，全速趕過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚，對不起啦，我只是想讓嘉維爾放個假休息一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，也好......那就趁機放鬆一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......所以，你們真的沒有惡意？你們不是奉哪位貴族之命來掠奪這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "信不信由你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......的確，就算是薩爾貢，也不會招徠你這樣粗魯的人為他們效力吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "粗魯？我只是不喜歡廢話而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的打算簡單得很，就是幫一把那個叫斯第奇的小鬼，給提亞卡烏換點派得上用場的技術，然後走人，就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島上可還有一堆病人等著我巡房呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼說，你還是個醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼，不像？我可是有執照的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是這位特米米小姐說自己是醫生，我還能勉強相信幾秒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，當醫生我也會的！嘉維爾教過我麻醉術！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找準部位，然後砰的一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島上的大家把這個叫，呃，“嘉維爾式動能麻醉術”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你聽我解釋，這種非常規的手段，就算是我，也只會在比較特殊的情況下使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比如說，恰好麻醉劑用完了，補充包又在揍人的時候丟了之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——我還是跟著你們吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別想在際崖城亂來，這是我的安身之所，我不會讓你們破壞它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隨你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會確保你們幹完該幹的事之後就離開際崖城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，在沒幹完之前，就悠閒地逛逛街吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個，阿芙朵嘉小姐......你是本地居民，能帶我們看看這座際崖城嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我事先說好，如果你們是想查探城內的地形，還是趁早放棄為好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不是的！我是想說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的衣品真好！有什麼值得一逛的杜林時尚小店嗎？我想......觀摩一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧，如果是這樣......的確有幾個去處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想看看杜林風格的首飾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯第奇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......卡奇，你來幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前你總把自己關在房間裡，今天真難得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我偶爾也會想曬曬太陽。你特意跑一趟，就是為了說這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你都想炸了我的滑梯了，還不許我找你聊聊天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔，你知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶奇大師告訴我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這老傢伙......你是來興師問罪的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，實際上我不反對，這個夏天過得已經夠久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我們作為建築設計師，最好的作品永遠是下一個，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，你就是這一點最讓人討厭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無時無刻不在冒傻氣這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，這評價還真高！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，作為同意你對大滑梯動手的條件，我還想和你聊聊穹頂的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......沒什麼好聊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，我們散散步，你好歹應該在炸了“大水坑”之前，去體驗幾個項目吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有嗎？下一屆可以在哪看？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼——哈！好酒！依娜姆，你要再來點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我這裡還有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喝得也太慢了吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那支叫“紅酒與咖啡”的隊伍也好可惜，就差一點點就能奪冠了！唉！明明離那艘船就差一步了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來你還算喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒想到你們地上人的生活，的確比我想像的有趣那麼一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這到底是什麼的錄影？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多索雷斯的“極限鐵人大獎賽”，這是我從一個跑商隊的朋友那裡搞來的老錄影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽說之前出了一次事故，也不知道這幾年有沒有繼續在辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸——我還沒看夠呢！我想看敗者隊伍第二年的復仇戰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克羅綺，如果引入一點點“競爭”，就連最無聊的娛樂都能刺激不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一邊為自己支持的隊伍助威，一邊和朋友痛飲麥酒，我想，任何杜林人都不會拒絕這樣的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，賽程期間，酒類和速食的銷售額一般都會翻倍。怎麼樣，很適合杜林們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "平常城裡的酒賣得就夠好了，恐怕不需要辦一場比賽來刺激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，嗯，從玩個痛快的角度看，的確很有誘惑力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就直說了吧，商業代表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想不想建一條超級水上賽道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
